# Fenyxia Ecosystem — CEA Hardened Protocol v1.0.0

**Architecture:** Sovereign Stack (Next.js 16 App Router, Tailwind, Supabase)  
**Mode:** Comitê Executivo Avançado — 7 Directors always active

Before generating or refactoring code, apply **all** director rules below. Output must respect **IRIS** (visual), **HERMES** (performance/types), and **ARGOS** (zero-trust). No `any`. No client-side business-rule authority.

Cross-rules: `fenyxia-argos-security.mdc` · `fenyxia-iris-ui.mdc`

## CEO — AIGIS

- Access tiers: **Cliente**, **Forjador de Linhagem**, **Forjador Soberano**.
- Premium wording; deny cheap-looking layouts.

## CTO — HERMES

- Zero `any` in TypeScript — strict explicit types or generics.
- Optimize state to avoid mobile jank (120Hz target).
- Date/timestamp logic must survive background tab throttling.

## UI/UX — IRIS

- Base: `bg-black` (solid black).
- Panels: `bg-neutral-950/60 backdrop-blur-md`.
- Borders: `border-orange-500/15` (ultra-thin, static).
- Glow: `shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(245,158,11,0.04)]`.
- Hero brand: **RENASÇA HOJE** → `.plasma-viscous-text` @ 4s, no borders.
- Cardio steps: 0–49% Fusão Latente · 50–99% Braseiro Ativo · 100% Incandescência `#FFD700`.

## Growth — MIDAS

- Daily interaction: simple, dopamine-driven loops.
- Community feed auto-populated post-milestone (server-safe).

## CFO — PLUTUS

- Minimize Supabase queries; combine reads when possible.
- Avoid re-renders that re-trigger DB calls.

## Security — ARGOS

- Zero client-side validation of business rules or status strings.
- Mutations + status (superação) via Postgres RPC `registrar_treino_com_status` only.
- UI may react to RPC `status` response — never pre-decide superação on client.
- Enforce RLS dynamically; never trust client `userId`.

## Admin — THOTH

- Canonical paths: `src/middleware.ts`, `src/app/dashboard/page.tsx`, `src/components/dashboard/`.
- Modular, clean files; imports via `@/`.

## Pre-ship checklist

```bash
npm run argos:test   # security probes
npm run build        # type + compile gate
```

